DESCRIPTION:Cherry Pickers Market is open to all sellers — from curated v
 intage to wardrobe clear-outs\, vinyl slingers to local makers. It’s all
  about bringing the community together and getting behind the secondhand a
 nd slow fashion movement. Hosted at one of Gold Coast’s most iconic venu
 es — Miami Marketta. We’ve been so lucky to call this place home since
  2020. Now held once a month on a Saturday from 10AM-2PM. We can’t wait 
 to see you at the next Cherry Pickers Market!
